# Full stack = this repository

This tree is the QPU full stack. There is no second app under `.qpu-app`.

## Upstream standards for `src`

Develop in `src/` against these `github.com/payloadcms/*` repositories:

| Upstream | Role in this repo |
|---|---|
| `payloadcms/website` | Layout standard for `src/` (collections, blocks, globals, App Router) |
| `payloadcms/payload` | Every `@payloadcms/*` package under `packages/*` — pin one version across the set |
| `payloadcms/skills` | Agent skill names/paths mapped in `TABLES.SKILL_MAP` |

## MCP

Mount one connector: `qpuMcpPlugin` from `@payloadcms/plugin-mcp` at `POST /api/mcp`. Do not invent a second MCP server or a second catalogue in `src`.

## Configure overlay

`configure { kind: 'fullstack' }` refreshes overlay files in this repository (`src/…`, notices, OpenNext). It does not clone or target a side fork.
